{"c":[{"name":"20261005T201333Z-fdcac01d5471b677","text":"L1: Cotypist's Gemma E2B is a base model, so local draft prompts are few-shot documents (writer/local-draft.ts); caret-local-model refuses a request with no grammar. localTextRequest.deadlineMs is epoch ms, not a duration.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204550Z-12e324b0b44784bf","text":"Fill throws labelTooLong when the focused field's label is over 80 chars on a page with little other prose (privacy prose share); saved answers can't be offered there.","type":"note"}]}
